{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QSMG1PaVAJowkoEhvy9rja","type":"tool_result","content":"=== SEAM-MAP ===\nschema_version: 1\nstatus: SEAM_MAP=READY\nintent_id: DI-RATE-LIMIT\nsource_recipe:\n  name: source-recipe.yaml\n  sha256: c9aa28e2046f2bde0bdc707800caccd9640f837f25505b75f41d09adec2afa0b\nintent_sha256: 32450ba0ab79597c8dfff607c36d34368ebe948a985e5d66cb04dea26bcebe2f\nsystem_map_sha256: 4e9c5552ee33e40afefe9f7832b558a7341e9e86b37bc3aa66ec46d7fad31779\nevidence_sha256: 955bf48075bd4c1f7517942d7e4883b9d9d315e217d05aeac6edf9d9e83c3c12\ndecisions:\n- id: ADR-RATE-LIMIT-ORDER\n  path: tasks/.plans/rate-limit/decisions/ADR-RATE-LIMIT-ORDER.md\n  status: accepted\n  sha256: a10ce522f4e3f8d3a0a92c86cc990345f488f06ecaf20ca3b099c005ec9d00b3\nseams:\n- id: SEAM-POLICY-CONTRACT\n  path: tasks/.plans/rate-limit/seams/SEAM-POLICY-CONTRACT.md\n  owner: platform-contracts\n  evidence:\n  - E-BLUEPRINT\n  swimlane_id: LANE-POLICY-CONTRACT\n  sha256: d266dc6e5d6fe0fcdd3a8858538ee4ec9675f380ef86c951a549a5ef68759ed1\n- id: SEAM-POLICY-RESOLUTION\n  path: tasks/.plans/rate-limit/seams/SEAM-POLICY-RESOLUTION.md\n  owner: policy-runtime\n  evidence:\n  - E-BLUEPRINT\n  swimlane_id: LANE-POLICY-RESOLUTION\n  sha256: 22133ad9493bfd8a334e5fac67c054e598241484201439a79892805ff02d2819\n- id: SEAM-REQUEST-ENFORCEMENT\n  path: tasks/.plans/rate-limit/seams/SEAM-REQUEST-ENFORCEMENT.md\n  owner: request-runtime\n  evidence:\n  - E-BLUEPRINT\n  swimlane_id: LANE-REQUEST-ENFORCEMENT\n  sha256: 525a0f9d372b3acc3fc2a36563e8f5f31b6dd663d12b4d5b0a1f66ec19aad504\n- id: SEAM-DECISION-VISIBILITY\n  path: tasks/.plans/rate-limit/seams/SEAM-DECISION-VISIBILITY.md\n  owner: reliability-interface\n  evidence:\n  - E-BLUEPRINT\n  swimlane_id: LANE-DECISION-VISIBILITY\n  sha256: 057f084a730d3070a1d5a08c34707a47e1f0647e5ec3c2875ca08c9fa94ad2fb\n=== SYSTEM-MAP ===\n---\nschema_version: 1\nkind: system-map\nclaim: proposed\ncomponents:\n- Policy contract boundary\n- Effective policy resolver\n- Request enforcement boundary\n- Decision response and telemetry boundary\nexternal_dependencies:\n- Organization identity supplied by the host application\n- Time-window and counter state supplied by an implementation-selected adapter\nunknowns: []\nproposed_steel_thread:\n- LEG-POLICY-SCHEMA-VALID\n- LEG-EFFECTIVE-POLICY-RESOLVED\n- LEG-REQUEST-101-DENIED\n- LEG-DENIAL-REASON-VISIBLE\nobjections:\n- id: OBJ-METERING-SEPARATION\n  status: FIXED\n  summary: Metering was removed from the canonical steel thread and kept external.\n  owner: example-fixture\n  rationale: The accepted boundary decision leaves metering outside the four-leg proving path.\ncontentions: []\n---\n# System Map\n\n## Components\n\n- Policy contract boundary\n- Effective policy resolver\n- Request enforcement boundary\n- Decision response and telemetry boundary\n\n## External dependencies\n\n- Organization identity supplied by the host application\n- Time-window and counter state supplied by an implementation-selected adapter\n\n## Unknowns\n\n- (none)\n\nThis is a **proposed** map. The delivery-plan transformation must\nclose or gate every material unknown; it may not reinterpret this text as\nruntime proof.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6624e82c-6454-45a5-b85d-1c433f495bcc","uuid":"e59f2c43-fc0d-437d-8d4f-df9fae8318ba","timestamp":"2026-09-14T21:30:07.158Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"=== SEAM-MAP ===\nschema_version: 1\nstatus: SEAM_MAP=READY\nintent_id: DI-RATE-LIMIT\nsource_recipe:\n  name: source-recipe.yaml\n  sha256: c9aa28e2046f2bde0bdc707800caccd9640f837f25505b75f41d09adec2afa0b\nintent_sha256: 32450ba0ab79597c8dfff607c36d34368ebe948a985e5d66cb04dea26bcebe2f\nsystem_map_sha256: 4e9c5552ee33e40afefe9f7832b558a7341e9e86b37bc3aa66ec46d7fad31779\nevidence_sha256: 955bf48075bd4c1f7517942d7e4883b9d9d315e217d05aeac6edf9d9e83c3c12\ndecisions:\n- id: ADR-RATE-LIMIT-ORDER\n  path: tasks/.plans/rate-limit/decisions/ADR-RATE-LIMIT-ORDER.md\n  status: accepted\n  sha256: a10ce522f4e3f8d3a0a92c86cc990345f488f06ecaf20ca3b099c005ec9d00b3\nseams:\n- id: SEAM-POLICY-CONTRACT\n  path: tasks/.plans/rate-limit/seams/SEAM-POLICY-CONTRACT.md\n  owner: platform-contracts\n  evidence:\n  - E-BLUEPRINT\n  swimlane_id: LANE-POLICY-CONTRACT\n  sha256: d266dc6e5d6fe0fcdd3a8858538ee4ec9675f380ef86c951a549a5ef68759ed1\n- id: SEAM-POLICY-RESOLUTION\n  path: tasks/.plans/rate-limit/seams/SEAM-POLICY-RESOLUTION.md\n  owner: policy-runtime\n  evidence:\n  - E-BLUEPRINT\n  swimlane_id: LANE-POLICY-RESOLUTION\n  sha256: 22133ad9493bfd8a334e5fac67c054e598241484201439a79892805ff02d2819\n- id: SEAM-REQUEST-ENFORCEMENT\n  path: tasks/.plans/rate-limit/seams/SEAM-REQUEST-ENFORCEMENT.md\n  owner: request-runtime\n  evidence:\n  - E-BLUEPRINT\n  swimlane_id: LANE-REQUEST-ENFORCEMENT\n  sha256: 525a0f9d372b3acc3fc2a36563e8f5f31b6dd663d12b4d5b0a1f66ec19aad504\n- id: SEAM-DECISION-VISIBILITY\n  path: tasks/.plans/rate-limit/seams/SEAM-DECISION-VISIBILITY.md\n  owner: reliability-interface\n  evidence:\n  - E-BLUEPRINT\n  swimlane_id: LANE-DECISION-VISIBILITY\n  sha256: 057f084a730d3070a1d5a08c34707a47e1f0647e5ec3c2875ca08c9fa94ad2fb\n=== SYSTEM-MAP ===\n---\nschema_version: 1\nkind: system-map\nclaim: proposed\ncomponents:\n- Policy contract boundary\n- Effective policy resolver\n- Request enforcement boundary\n- Decision response and telemetry boundary\nexternal_dependencies:\n- Organization identity supplied by the host application\n- Time-window and counter state supplied by an implementation-selected adapter\nunknowns: []\nproposed_steel_thread:\n- LEG-POLICY-SCHEMA-VALID\n- LEG-EFFECTIVE-POLICY-RESOLVED\n- LEG-REQUEST-101-DENIED\n- LEG-DENIAL-REASON-VISIBLE\nobjections:\n- id: OBJ-METERING-SEPARATION\n  status: FIXED\n  summary: Metering was removed from the canonical steel thread and kept external.\n  owner: example-fixture\n  rationale: The accepted boundary decision leaves metering outside the four-leg proving path.\ncontention