{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf43YfmsdApDYhd64vjqp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LngGqckymoAUJbVKbDSqc2","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/private/var/folders/zf/r0gsd5px2v9_q24j3tfnyb5c0000gn/T/taskspec chat xrt4d131\" && bash \"/private/tmp/taskspec-chat-qualification-engines/3.10.0/bin/taskspec\" agent-context 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \"\nimport json,sys\nd=json.load(sys.stdin)\nfor k,v in d['commands'].items():\n    if 'decompose' in k or 'status' in k or 'review' in k:\n        print(k,'|',v.get('summary'),'|',v.get('tokens'),'|',v.get('usage'))\n\"","description":"List decompose-related CLI commands"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1860,"cache_read_input_tokens":25596,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1860},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6624e82c-6454-45a5-b85d-1c433f495bcc","uuid":"4e479d20-294f-4af9-b8c5-ae5fd4faff18","timestamp":"2026-09-14T21:30:38.187Z","request_id":"req_011Cf43YfKLFLPh7bvsrsvry","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01LngGqckymoAUJbVKbDSqc2":{"command":"cd \"/private/var/folders/zf/r0gsd5px2v9_q24j3tfnyb5c0000gn/T/taskspec chat xrt4d131\" && bash \"/private/tmp/taskspec-chat-qualification-engines/3.10.0/bin/taskspec\" agent-context 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \"\nimport json,sys\nd=json.load(sys.stdin)\nfor k,v in d['commands'].items():\n    if 'decompose' in k or 'status' in k or 'review' in k:\n        print(k,'|',v.get('summary'),'|',v.get('tokens'),'|',v.get('usage'))\n\"","description":"List decompose-related CLI commands"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LngGqckymoAUJbVKbDSqc2","type":"tool_result","content":"status | none; emits TaskStatus/v1 and exactly one safe next command | ['NEXT=<command>', 'STATUS=INVALID'] | Usage: taskspec status <task-id-or-path> [--json] | taskspec status --initiative <id>\ndecompose | Native intent decomposition, signed topology review, and TaskPlan compilation. | [] | Usage: taskspec decompose init|prepare|review|compile|status|impact|import <initiative> [options]\ndecompose init | Create explicit intent workspace. | [] | Usage: taskspec decompose init <initiative> --intent-file <file|->\ndecompose prepare | Validate and project an authored recipe; never approve it. | [] | Usage: taskspec decompose prepare <initiative> --recipe <file> [--replace]\ndecompose review | Authenticate explicit approval of the current topology. | [] | Usage: taskspec decompose review <initiative> --accept --reviewer <name> --reason <text>\ndecompose compile | Compile reviewed topology and lineage without sealing leaves. | [] | Usage: taskspec decompose compile <initiative>\ndecompose status | Explain planning blockers and next valid action. | [] | Usage: taskspec decompose status <initiative>\ndecompose impact | Compare leaf projections to identify affected authorizations. | [] | Usage: taskspec decompose impact <initiative> --against <bundle-or-snapshot.json>\ndecompose import | Explicitly import originals; fresh native review required. | [] | Usage: taskspec decompose import <initiative> --source <workspace>\nsetup decompose | Provision locked dependencies in the private runtime. | [] | Usage: taskspec setup decompose \nmesh status | Use the existing TaskMesh status operation. | [] | Usage: taskspec mesh status [<run-or-attempt>]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6624e82c-6454-45a5-b85d-1c433f495bcc","uuid":"6a9a9f49-69a3-449f-999d-cb58add0cfb2","timestamp":"2026-09-14T21:30:38.317Z","tool_use_result":{"std